# The "full" flavour is a self-contained PyInstaller bundle: it deliberately ships the
# Python interpreter, GTK, libmpv with ffmpeg and every other library it needs, so the
# distribution's copies of them cannot break it. Lintian rightly notices that this is
# not how Debian packages are normally built.
# I know this is stupid but needed for one of my setups.
